WEBVTT

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:07.193
(roars)

00:00:08.237 --> 00:00:10.098
Um, what just happened?

00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:12.065
Oh, that. (chuckles)
Viva just braided your hair.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.666
(whispers):
It means she likes you.

00:00:13.802 --> 00:00:15.202
It means I like you!

00:00:15.337 --> 00:00:16.904
We're gonna have
the best family reunion ever.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.413
VIVA:
And big, long talk with Dad.

00:00:19.548 --> 00:00:20.907
POPPY:
Ha! King of secrets, that guy.

00:00:21.042 --> 00:00:22.582
VIVA:
Right? What is his deal?

00:00:22.718 --> 00:00:25.783
POPPY: Oh, he's gonna be
so happy to see you.

00:00:27.448 --> 00:00:29.887
Hey, Viva, do you want to make
candy necklaces

00:00:30.023 --> 00:00:32.292
that we never finish
because we eat all the candy?

00:00:32.427 --> 00:00:33.991
Great minds think alike, Daddy.

00:00:34.127 --> 00:00:34.820
(laughs)

00:00:34.956 --> 00:00:36.759
Whew, looking good, Bruce.

00:00:36.895 --> 00:00:38.191
(chuckling):
You bet. Hey, down.

00:00:38.326 --> 00:00:40.628
No pulling out
Daddy's chest hair. Ow!

00:00:40.763 --> 00:00:42.028
Kids, cover your ears.

00:00:42.164 --> 00:00:43.969
You look hot.
Honey, break a leg.

00:00:44.105 --> 00:00:46.068
Branch, I'm sorry we didn't
get to see you grow up,

00:00:46.203 --> 00:00:48.570
but I'm excited to get
to hang out with you now.

00:00:48.705 --> 00:00:50.004
Yeah, same here, Clay.

00:00:50.139 --> 00:00:52.045
Hey, you want to join
my sad book club?

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:53.305
It's really cool.

00:00:53.441 --> 00:00:55.249
We just sit around
and hug and stuff and cry.

00:00:55.384 --> 00:00:57.583
(chuckling):
Yeah, totally.

00:00:57.719 --> 00:00:59.446
- CROWD: BroZone! BroZone!
- What's up?

00:00:59.581 --> 00:01:01.349
- You got the preshow jitters?
- ("BroZone" chant continues)

00:01:01.484 --> 00:01:04.086
I can't believe that we almost
missed out on all this.

00:01:04.221 --> 00:01:06.560
We may not be the new kids
on the block anymore,

00:01:06.695 --> 00:01:08.722
but I'm loving
this new edition of us.

00:01:08.858 --> 00:01:10.190
You know, I'm really glad

00:01:10.326 --> 00:01:12.024
those 98 degrees of separation
are behind us.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.061
Just as long as we're together.

00:01:14.197 --> 00:01:17.470
Mm. Hey, you guys
got to try this menudo.

00:01:17.606 --> 00:01:19.703
Guys, are we sure
this is the place?

00:01:19.839 --> 00:01:21.537
Well, it does match
the postcard.

00:01:21.672 --> 00:01:23.105
"Wish you were here"?

00:01:23.241 --> 00:01:25.045
Branch is the only one I know
who talks like that.

00:01:25.181 --> 00:01:26.807
Oh, here we go now!

00:01:26.943 --> 00:01:29.611
That new song is sick, Branch.

00:01:29.746 --> 00:01:31.318
I knew you had it in you.

00:01:31.453 --> 00:01:32.784
(chuckles):
Oh, yeah, thanks.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.147
It's, you know,
just a little something

00:01:34.283 --> 00:01:36.417
me and a few of my buddies
were working on.

00:01:36.552 --> 00:01:37.956
What?

00:01:38.926 --> 00:01:41.254
- (trolls whistling a tune)
- Hey, here they are now.

00:01:43.492 --> 00:01:45.926
What? You didn't think
BroZone was the only band

00:01:46.061 --> 00:01:48.099
I've ever been in, did you?

00:01:48.235 --> 00:01:49.328
Please.

00:01:49.463 --> 00:01:52.171
Now, these guys know
how to flex the drip.

00:01:52.307 --> 00:01:53.534
You are so in sync.

00:01:53.669 --> 00:01:55.167
(laughter)

00:01:55.303 --> 00:01:57.142
BRANCH:
Did you hear what he said?

00:01:57.277 --> 00:01:58.342
(chuckles)

00:01:58.478 --> 00:01:59.845
I don't get it.

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:01.474
POPPY: Hey, Branch,
it's almost showtime,

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:03.211
and I was just thinking
that maybe we could... What?!

00:02:03.346 --> 00:02:07.788
♪ Just let me take you
to a better place ♪

00:02:07.924 --> 00:02:11.988
